==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM-P Promo|Golett|386}}, one of the {{TCG|SM-P Promotional cards}}.
*'''Stampede''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Phanpy|62}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
